<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower in active trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 247.37 to 7694.66. For the week, the Dow fell 336.56.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 10.56 to 469.10. For the week, the index fell 14.69.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.99.</p>
<p>Declines beat advances 2116 to 714.</p>
<p>Volume was 534,412,170 compared with 530,469,530 on Thursday. Weekly volume was 2,641,692,170.</p>
<p>The Standard &amp; Poor's 500 Index fell 23.96 to 900.81.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT).</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
